<title>NETHERLANDS: FLEXOVIT 1996 NET PROFIT FALLS 40 PCT.</title>
<headline>FLEXOVIT 1996 NET PROFIT FALLS 40 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>DEVENTER, Netherlands 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     1.17 vs   1.98</p>
<p>    Total net profit		     6.3  vs  10.4</p>
<p>    Net from ordinary operations     6.9  vs  10.1</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  0.60 vs   1.12</p>
<p>    Turnover			     178.0  vs 160.3</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    14.0  vs  16.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Abrasives maker Flexovit International NV previously</p>
<p>said it expected a recovery in the second half of 1996 after</p>
<p>first-half profits fell by 29 percent.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
